---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../styles/retail.css';
---
<Base
  title="About &mdash; Airborne Dent Repair"
  description="Airborne Dent Repair is a veteran owned paintless dent, hail, windshield and XPEL tint shop in Gunter, Texas. Founded by a U.S. Army paratrooper, Master ARC certified, lifetime warranty on paintless work."
  nav="About" css="retail">
<main>

<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero-panel">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Veteran Owned &amp; Operated</p>
    <h1 class="display h-xl rv rv-d1">Airborne Isn&rsquo;t<br>Just A Name.</h1>
    <p class="lede rv rv-d2">We stepped off the assembly line on purpose. Fewer vehicles on the floor, more attention on each one, and the same standard on the last panel as the first.</p>
    <div class="cta-row rv rv-d2">
      <a class="btn btn-solid" href="/contact">Get a free estimate <span>&rarr;</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="tel:+16822260543">Call 682-226-0543</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="hero-facts rv rv-d3">
      <li>Veteran owned</li><li>Master ARC certified</li><li>Gunter, TX &middot; serving DFW</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-figure">
    <img class="shot-img" src="/img/shop-exterior-fleet-lineup-1200.jpg"
         srcset="/img/shop-exterior-fleet-lineup-1200.jpg 1200w, /img/shop-exterior-fleet-lineup-2400.jpg 2400w"
         sizes="(min-width:980px) 42vw, 100vw" width="1200" height="800" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"
         alt="Vehicles lined up along the Airborne Dent Repair building at 489 Reed Ln in Gunter, Texas">
    <span class="slot-tag hero-slot-tag">489 Reed Ln, Unit 2 &middot; Gunter, Texas</span>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="marquee-track">
    <ul>
      <li>Veteran Owned &amp; Operated</li>
      <li>Master ARC Certified</li>
      <li>Lifetime PDR Warranty</li>
      <li>Loaner Vehicles Available</li>
      <li>Free Estimates</li>
      <li>We Work With Your Insurance</li>
    </ul>
    <ul>
      <li>Veteran Owned &amp; Operated</li>
      <li>Master ARC Certified</li>
      <li>Lifetime PDR Warranty</li>
      <li>Loaner Vehicles Available</li>
      <li>Free Estimates</li>
      <li>We Work With Your Insurance</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<section>
  <div class="wrap intro">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">The Founder</p>
      <h2 class="display h-md rv rv-d1" style="margin-block:1rem 1.25rem;max-width:18ch">Geronimo.</h2>
      <p class="prose rv rv-d2">Our founder served as a U.S. Army paratrooper with 1st Battalion (Airborne), 501st Infantry Regiment &mdash; the Geronimos &mdash; out of Joint Base Elmendorf-Richardson, Alaska, under 4th Infantry Brigade Combat Team (Airborne), 25th Infantry Division.</p>
      <p class="prose rv rv-d2" style="margin-top:1rem">He came home and spent more than five years managing sales teams and running high-volume hail operations that moved hundreds of damaged vehicles a month. That is long enough to learn something most shops never admit out loud: when the only number anyone measures is how many cars went out the door, the work suffers. Not occasionally. Every time.</p>
      <p class="prose rv rv-d2" style="margin-top:1rem">So we built the opposite of that.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rv rv-d1">
      <div class="slot" style="aspect-ratio:4/5;max-width:420px">
        <span class="slot-tag">Photo pending &mdash; [OWNER-PORTRAIT], in the shop, natural light</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<figure class="band band-high" style="margin:0">
  <img class="shot-img" src="/img/shop-dusk-headlights-1200.jpg"
       srcset="/img/shop-dusk-headlights-1200.jpg 1200w, /img/shop-dusk-headlights-2400.jpg 2400w"
       sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
       alt="Three vehicles parked at dusk with their headlights on">
  <figcaption class="band-cap">Open until 7:00 PM, Monday through Saturday</figcaption>
</figure>

<section>
  <div class="wrap intro">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">How The Shop Runs</p>
      <h2 class="display h-md rv rv-d1" style="margin-block:1rem 1.25rem;max-width:20ch">Off The Assembly Line, On Purpose.</h2>
      <p class="prose rv rv-d2">Airborne Dent Repair stepped off the assembly line on purpose. Fewer vehicles on the floor, more attention on each one, and the same standard on the last panel as the first. Every paintless repair carries a lifetime warranty, because we would rather take the time now than see the car twice.</p>
      <p class="prose rv rv-d2" style="margin-top:1rem">We do not rush jobs and we do not cut corners. That is the whole business model.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rv rv-d1">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:1rem">The Shop, In Facts</p>
      <dl class="facts">
        <div><dt>Founded by</dt><dd>A U.S. Army paratrooper, 1-501st Infantry (Airborne)</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Technician</dt><dd>Master ARC certified</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Address</dt><dd>489 Reed Ln, Unit 2, Gunter, TX 75058</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Estimates</dt><dd>Free</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Paintless dent &amp; hail</dt><dd>Lifetime warranty</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Window tint</dt><dd>XPEL exclusively, manufacturer&rsquo;s warranty</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Windshields</dt><dd>Mobile or in-shop</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Wholesale capacity</dt><dd>Up to 25 vehicles a week</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Hours</dt><dd>Mon&ndash;Sat 9:00 AM &ndash; 7:00 PM &middot; Closed Sunday</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap sec-head lead">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Where We Work</p>
    <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1">Gunter Is Home Base.<br>The Work Isn&rsquo;t.</h2>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="steps steps-3">
  <div class="step rv">
    <p class="n">01</p>
    <h3>Headquarters</h3>
    <p>489 Reed Ln, Unit 2, Gunter, Texas. Drop-off, loaner keys, and all four services under one roof.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="step rv rv-d1">
    <p class="n">02</p>
    <h3>Greater DFW &amp; North Texas</h3>
    <p>We serve drivers across the metroplex and North Texas &mdash; routine repairs, mobile windshield service, and dealer accounts.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="step rv rv-d2">
    <p class="n">03</p>
    <h3>Anywhere the storm lands</h3>
    <p>When a severe storm hits somewhere else, we deploy catastrophe response teams to the affected area anywhere in the country.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section>
  <div class="wrap sec-head lead">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">What Comes Through The Bay</p>
    <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1">From A Rolls-Royce<br>To A Work Truck.</h2>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="gallery">
  <figure class="gal rv rv-d0"><span class="shot" role="img" aria-label="A white Rolls-Royce Dawn in the shop" style="background-image:url('/img/gallery-rolls-royce-dawn.jpg')"></span><figcaption>Rolls-Royce Dawn</figcaption></figure>
  <figure class="gal rv rv-d1"><span class="shot" role="img" aria-label="A black Mercedes-AMG G 63" style="background-image:url('/img/gallery-amg-g63-front.jpg')"></span><figcaption>AMG G 63</figcaption></figure>
  <figure class="gal rv rv-d2"><span class="shot" role="img" aria-label="A matte grey Ram TRX" style="background-image:url('/img/gallery-ram-trx.jpg')"></span><figcaption>Ram TRX</figcaption></figure>
  <figure class="gal rv rv-d3"><span class="shot" role="img" aria-label="A Volkswagen Passat hood read under shop lighting" style="background-image:url('/img/gallery-vw-passat-REDACTED.jpg')"></span><figcaption>Volkswagen Passat</figcaption></figure>
</div>

<a class="cross" href="/wholesale">
  <p class="eyebrow">Dealer, body shop or fleet?</p>
  <h2 class="display h-sm">Wholesale &amp; Fleet Accounts</h2>
  <p>Pickup and delivery, up to 25 vehicles a week, and the same lifetime warranty on every
    paintless repair we perform.</p>
  <span class="go">See wholesale <span>&rarr;</span></span>
</a>

<section class="final">
  <div class="wrap final-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Gunter, Texas &middot; Serving DFW &amp; North Texas</p>
      <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1" style="margin-block:1rem 1.25rem;max-width:16ch">Get A Free Estimate.</h2>
      <div class="cta-row rv rv-d2">
        <a class="btn btn-solid" href="tel:+16822260543">Call 682-226-0543</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="mailto:airbornepdr@gmail.com">Email the shop <span>&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-block rv rv-d1">
      <strong>Airborne Dent Repair</strong>
      <span>489 Reed Ln, Unit 2</span>
      <span style="margin-bottom:.6rem">Gunter, TX 75058</span>
      <a href="mailto:airbornepdr@gmail.com">airbornepdr@gmail.com</a>
      <a href="tel:+16822260543">682-226-0543</a>
      <span>Fax 833-907-5267</span>
      <span style="margin-top:.6rem">Mon&ndash;Sat 9:00 AM &ndash; 7:00 PM &middot; Closed Sunday</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</main>
</Base>
